      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "Independent component and harmonic indices make the fractal-string frequency Dirichlet series factor as a geometric series times zeta. By contrast, the infinite product of prime-local operators is explicitly undefined, so the field-theory proposal replaces that motivation with a separately defined global zeta pseudodifferential symbol; the scalar Euler product does not supply factor-by-factor operator composition.",
